-- Machine-specific plugin specs — copy to lua/plugins/local.lua (git-ignored).
--
-- LazyVim automatically loads every lua/plugins/*.lua file. The .example
-- suffix prevents this file itself from being loaded; the actual local.lua
-- is git-ignored so machine-specific plugins never appear in the repo.
--
-- Usage:
--   cp lua/plugins/local.lua.example lua/plugins/local.lua
--   # Edit local.lua with machine-specific plugin specs, then restart Neovim.

return {}
